    "text": "If the lines $\\frac{x-1}{2} = \\frac{y+1}{3} = \\frac{z-1}{4}$ and $\\frac{x-3}{1} = \\frac{y-k}{2} = \\frac{z}{1}$ intersect, then the value of $k$ is",
