    "type": "numerical",
    "text": "A plane which is perpendicular to two planes $2x-2y+z=0$ and $x-y+2z=4$ , passes through $(1,-2,1)$ . The distance of the plane from the point ( $1,2,2$ ) is",
    "images": [],
