    "type": "subjective",
    "text": "Two lines having direction ratios $(1,0,-1)$ and $(1,-1,0)$ are parallel to a plane passing through $(1,1,1)$ . This plane cuts co-ordinate axes at $A,B,C$ . Find volume of tetrahedron $OABC$ .",
