    "number": "45",
    "type": "numerical",
    "text": "Consider the following linear equations $ax+by+cz=0$ $bx+cy+az=0$ $cx+ay+bz=0$ Match the conditions/expressions in Column I with statements in Column II. (i) $a+b+c\\neq 0$ and",
    "images": [],
