    "id": "jee_adv_math_d_geometry_53",
    "number": "53",
    "type": "numerical",
    "text": "If the distance between the plane $Ax-2y+z=d$ and the plane containing the lines $\\frac{x-1}{2} = \\frac{y-2}{3} = \\frac{z-3}{4}$ and $\\frac{x-2}{2} = \\frac{y-3}{4} = \\frac{z-4}{5}$ is $\\sqrt{6}$ , then $|d|$ is",
    "images": [],
