    "text": "Let $f,g$ and $h$ be real-valued functions defined on the interval $[0,1]$ by $f(x)={e}^{{x}^{2}}+{e}^{-{x}^{2}},g(x)=x{e}^{{x}^{2}}+{e}^{-{x}^{2}}$ and $h(x)={x}^{2}{e}^{{x}^{2}}+{e}^{-{x}^{2}}$ . If $a,b$ and $c$ denote, respectively, the absolute maximum of $f,g$ and $h$ on $[0,1]$ , then",
