    "id": "jee_adv_math_application_of_calculus_119",
    "number": "119",
    "type": "subjective",
    "text": "Let $(1,1),(-1,1),(-1,-1),(1,-1)$ be a vertices of the square and $S$ the region of all the points insides the square which are nearer to the origin than to any edge. Sketch the region $S$ and find its area.",
    "images": [],
