    "text": "Let $f(x)= \\left( \\begin{bmatrix} x{e}^{ax} & ,x\\leq 0 \\\\ x+a{x}^{2}-{x}^{3}, & x>0 \\end{bmatrix} \\right)$ Where $a$ is a positive constant. Find the interval in which ${f}^{'}(x)$ is increasing.",
