    "id": "jee_adv_math_application_of_calculus_144",
    "number": "144",
    "type": "true_false",
    "text": "If $x-r$ is a factor of the polynomial $f(x)={a}_{n}{x}^{4}+…$ . $+{a}_{0}$ , repeated $m$ times $(1<m\\leq n)$ , then $r$ is a root of ${f}^{'}(x)=0$ repeated $m$ times.",
    "images": [],
