    "id": "jee_adv_math_application_of_calculus_171",
    "number": "171",
    "type": "numerical",
    "text": "Let $p(x)$ be a real polynomial of least degree which has a local maximum at $x=1$ and a local minimum at $x=3$ . If $p(1)=6$ and $p(3)=2$ , then ${p}^{'}(0)$ is",
    "images": [],
