    "text": "Coefficient of ${x}^{11}$ in the expansion of ${\\left( 1+{x}^{2} \\right)}^{4}{\\left( 1+{x}^{3} \\right)}^{7}{\\left( 1+{x}^{4} \\right)}^{12}$ is",
