    "type": "subjective",
    "text": "Prove that ${\\left( {}^{2n}{C}_{0} \\right)}^{2}-{\\left( {}^{2n}{C}_{1} \\right)}^{2}+{\\left( {}^{2n}{C}_{2} \\right)}^{2}+….+{\\left( {}^{2n}{C}_{2n} \\right)}^{2}$ $=(-1{)}^{n2n}{C}_{n}$ .",
