    "type": "subjective",
    "text": "Prove that ${C}_{1}^{2}-2⋅{C}_{2}^{2}+3⋅{C}_{3}^{2}-……..-2n⋅{C}_{2n}^{2}$ $=(-1{)}^{n-1}n⋅{C}_{n}$ .",
    "images": [],
