    "type": "fill_in_the_blanks",
    "text": "If $(1+ax{)}^{n}=1+8x+24{x}^{2}+…$ then $a=$ $$ $n=$ $$ $(1+ax{)}^{n}=1+n(ax)+ \\frac{n(n-1)}{2} (ax{)}^{2}+…$",
