    "text": "The angle between a pair of tangents drawn from a point $P$ to the circle ${x}^{2}+{y}^{2}+4x-6y+9{sin}^{2}\\alpha +$ $13{cos}^{2}\\alpha =0$ is $2\\alpha$ . Then the locus of $P$ is",
