    "text": "If ${I}_{n}$ represents area of $n$ -sided regular polygon inscribed in a unit circle and ${O}_{n}$ the area of the $n$ -sided regular polygon circumscribing it, prove that ${I}_{n}= \\frac{{O}_{n}}{2} \\left( 1+ \\sqrt{1-{\\left( \\frac{2{I}_{n}}{n} \\right)}^{2}} \\right)$ .",
