    "id": "jee_adv_math_complex_number_7",
    "number": "7",
    "type": "single mcq",
    "text": "If $a,b,c;u,v,w$ are complex numbers representing the vertices of two triangles such that $c=(1-r)a+rb$ , $w=(1-r)u+rv$ where $r$ is a complex number, the two triangles:",
    "images": [],
