    "id": "jee_adv_math_complex_number_8",
    "number": "8",
    "type": "single mcq",
    "text": "If ${z}_{1}$ and ${z}_{2}$ are two non - zero complex numbers such that $\\left( {z}_{1}+{z}_{2} \\right) = \\left( {z}_{1} \\right) + \\left( {z}_{2} \\right)$ , then $Arg{z}_{1}-Arg{z}_{2}$ is equal to",
