    "id": "jee_adv_math_complex_number_11",
    "number": "11",
    "type": "single mcq",
    "text": "If $ω(\\neq 1)$ is a cube root of unity and $(1+ω{)}^{7}=A+Bω$ then $A$ and $B$ are respectively",
