    "text": "For positive integers ${n}_{1}$ and ${n}_{2}$ the values of the expression $(1+i{)}^{{n}_{1}}+{\\left( 1+{i}^{3} \\right)}^{{n}_{1}}+{\\left( 1+{i}^{5} \\right)}^{{n}_{2}}+{\\left( 1+{i}^{7} \\right)}^{{n}_{2}}$ when $i= \\sqrt{-1}$ is real if and only if",
