    "text": "If $i= \\sqrt{-1}$ , then $4+5{\\left( \\frac{-1}{2} + \\frac{i \\sqrt{3}}{2} \\right)}^{334}+3{\\left( \\frac{-1}{2} + \\frac{i \\sqrt{3}}{2} \\right)}^{365}$ is equal to",
