    "id": "jee_adv_math_complex_number_22",
    "number": "22",
    "type": "single mcq",
    "text": "Let $ω=- \\frac{1}{2} +i \\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}$ . Then the value of $\\left( \\begin{bmatrix} 1 & 1 & 1 \\\\ 1 & -1-{ω}^{2} & {ω}^{2} \\\\ 1 & {ω}^{2} & {ω}^{4} \\end{bmatrix} \\right)$",
    "images": [],
