    "id": "jee_adv_math_complex_number_27",
    "number": "27",
    "type": "numerical",
    "text": "The minimum value of $\\left( a+bω+c{ω}^{2} \\right)$ , where $a,b$ and $c$ are all not equal integers and ( $ω\\neq 1$ ) is a cube root of unity, is",
    "images": [],
