    "id": "jee_adv_math_complex_number_82",
    "number": "82",
    "type": "fill_in_the_blanks",
    "text": "Suppose ${z}_{1},{z}_{2},{z}_{3}$ are the vertices of an equilateral triangle inscribed in the circle $\\left( {z}_{1} \\right) =2$ . If ${z}_{1}=1+i \\sqrt{3}$ then ${z}_{2}=__$ and ${z}_{3}=$ _____",
