    "type": "single mcq",
    "text": "Let $f$ be a positive function. Let ${I}_{1}={∫}_{1-k}^{k} xf[x(1-x)]dx$ , ${I}_{2}={∫}_{1-k}^{k} f[x(1-x)]dx$ , where $2k-1>0$ , Then $\\frac{{I}_{1}}{{I}_{2}}$ is",
