    "text": "Let $g(x)={∫}_{0}^{x} f(t)dt$ , where $f$ is such that $\\frac{1}{2} \\leq f(t)\\leq 1$ for $t\\in [0,1]$ and $0\\leq f(t)\\leq \\frac{1}{2}$ for $t\\in [1,2]$ then $g(2)$ satisfies the inequality,",
