    "type": "single mcq",
    "text": "If $f(x)= \\left( \\begin{bmatrix} {e}^{cosx}sinx, & for |x|\\leq 2 \\\\ 2, & otherwise \\end{bmatrix} \\right)$ then ${∫}_{-2}^{3} f(x)dx$",
