    "text": "Let $f:(0,\\infty )\\rightarrow R$ and $F(x)={∫}_{0}^{x} f(t)dt$ . If $F \\left( {x}^{2} \\right) ={x}^{2}(1+x)$ , then $f(4)$ equals",
