    "text": "Let $T>0$ , be a fixed real number. Suppose $f$ is a continuous function. Such that for all $x\\in R$ . $f(x+T)=f(x)$ . If $I={∫}_{0}^{T} f(x)dx$ , then the value of ${∫}_{3}^{3+3T} f(2x)dx$ is",
