    "text": "If ${∫}_{sinx}^{1} {t}^{2}f(t)dt=1-sinx∀x\\in \\left( 0, \\frac{\\pi }{2} \\right)$ then $f \\left( \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{3}} \\right)$ is",
