    "text": "Let $f$ be a non-negative function defined on the interval $[0,1]$ . If ${∫}_{0}^{x} \\sqrt{1-{\\left( {f}^{'}(t) \\right)}^{2}} dt={∫}_{0}^{x} f(t)dt,0\\leq x\\leq 1$ , and $f(0)=0$ , then",
