    "text": "Let ${f}^{'}(x)= \\frac{192{x}^{3}}{2+{sin}^{4}\\pi x}$ for all $x\\in R$ with $f \\left( \\frac{1}{2} \\right) =0$ . If $m\\leq \\int\\limits_{1/2}^{1} f(x)dx\\leq M$ , then the possible values of $m$ and $M$ are",
