    "text": "Evaluate $\\int\\limits_{2}^{3} \\frac{2{x}^{5}+{x}^{4}-2{x}^{3}+2{x}^{2}+1}{\\left( {x}^{2}+1 \\right) \\left( {x}^{4}-1 \\right)} dx$",
