    "type": "fill_in_the_blanks",
    "text": "Let $\\frac{d}{dx} F(x)= \\frac{{e}^{sinx}}{x} ,x>0$ if If ${∫}_{1}^{4} 2 \\frac{{e}^{sin{x}^{2}}}{x} dx=F(k)-F(1)$ then one of the possible values of $k$ is __________",
