    "text": "Let $f:R\\rightarrow R$ be a function defined by $f(x)= \\left( \\begin{bmatrix} [x], & x\\leq 2 \\\\ 0, & x>2 \\end{bmatrix} \\right)$ , where $[x]$ is the greatest integer less than or equal to $x$ . If $I= \\int\\limits_{-1}^{2} \\frac{xf \\left( {x}^{2} \\right)}{2+f(x+1)} dx$ , then the value of ( $4I-1$ ) is",
