    "text": "If $\\alpha = \\int\\limits_{0}^{1} \\left( {e}^{9x+3{tan}^{-1}x} \\right) \\left( \\frac{12+9{x}^{2}}{1+{x}^{2}} \\right) dx$ where ${tan}^{-1}x$ takes only principal values, then the value of $\\left( {log}_{e}|1+\\alpha |- \\frac{3\\pi }{4} \\right)$ is",
