    "type": "numerical",
    "text": "The solution of primitive equation $\\left( {x}^{2}+{y}^{2} \\right) dy=xydx$ , is $y=y(x)$ . If $y(1)=1$ and $y \\left( {x}_{0} \\right) =e$ , then ${x}_{0}$ is",
    "images": [],
