    "type": "single mcq",
    "text": "A curve passes through the point $\\left( 1, \\frac{\\pi }{6} \\right)$ . Let the slope of the curve at each point $(x,y)$ be $\\frac{y}{x} +sec \\left( \\frac{y}{x} \\right)$ , $x>0$ . Then the equation of the curve is",
    "images": [],
