    "type": "numerical",
    "text": "The function $y=f(x)$ is the solution of the differential equation $\\frac{dy}{dx} + \\frac{xy}{{x}^{2}-1} = \\frac{{x}^{4}+2x}{\\sqrt{1-{x}^{2}}}$ in $(-1,1)$ satisfying $f(0)=0$ . Then ${∫}_{- \\sqrt{3} /2}^{\\sqrt{3} /2} f(x)dx$ is",
