    "text": "If $y=y(x)$ satisfies the differential equation $8 \\sqrt{x} ( \\sqrt{9+ \\sqrt{x}} )dy=( \\sqrt{4+ \\sqrt{9+ \\sqrt{x}}} {)}^{-1}dx,x>0$ and $y(0)= \\sqrt{7}$ , then $y(256)=$",
