    "type": "multiple mcq",
    "text": "For $x\\in R$ , let the function $y(x)$ be the solution of the differential equation $\\frac{dy}{dx} +12y=cos \\left( \\frac{\\pi }{12} x \\right) ,y(0)=0$ . Then, which of the following statements is/are true?",
