    "text": "Let $f:R\\rightarrow R$ be a differentiable function with $f(0)=0$ . If $y=f(x)$ satisfies the differential equation $\\frac{dy}{dx} =(2+5y)(5y-2)$ , then the value of ${lim}_{x\\rightarrow -\\infty } f(x)$ is __________ .",
    "images": [],
