    "type": "numerical",
    "text": "Let $f:R\\rightarrow R$ be a differentiable function with $f(0)=1$ and satisfying the equation $f(x+y)=f(x){f}^{'}(y)+{f}^{'}(x)f(y)$ for all $x,y\\in R$ . Then, the value of ${log}_{e}(f(4))$ is __________ .",
