    "text": "The normal at a point $P$ on the ellipse ${x}^{2}+4{y}^{2}=16$ meets the $x$ -axis at $Q$ . If $M$ is the mid point of the line segment $PQ$ , then the locus of $M$ intersects the latus rectum of the given ellipse at the points",
