    "type": "multiple mcq",
    "text": "Let $P \\left( {x}_{1},{y}_{1} \\right)$ and $Q \\left( {x}_{2},{y}_{2} \\right) ,{y}_{1}<0,{y}_{2}<0$ , be the end points of the latus rectum of the ellipse ${x}^{2}+4{y}^{2}=4$ . The equations of parabolas with latus rectum $PQ$ are",
