    "text": "If $F(x)={\\left( f \\left( \\frac{x}{2} \\right) \\right)}^{2}+{\\left( g \\left( \\frac{x}{2} \\right) \\right)}^{2}$ where ${f}^{''}(x)=-f(x)$ and $g(x)={f}^{'}(x)$ and given that $F(5)=5$ , then $F(10)$ is equal to",
