    "text": "Let $f(x)={x}^{2}$ and $g(x)=sinx$ for all $x\\in R$ . Then the set of all $x$ satisfying $(f∘g∘g∘f)(x)=(g∘g∘f)(x)$ , where $(f∘g)(x)=f(g(x))$ , is",
