    "id": "jee_adv_math_function_43",
    "number": "43",
    "type": "subjective",
    "text": "Let $y= \\sqrt{\\frac{(x+1)(x-3)}{(x-2)}}$ . Find all the real values of $x$ for which $y$ takes real values.",
