    "text": "If ${f}_{1}(x)$ and ${f}_{2}(x)$ are defined by domains ${D}_{1}$ and ${D}_{2}$ respectively, then ${f}_{1}(x)+{f}_{2}(x)$ is defined as on ${D}_{1}\\cap {D}_{2}$ .",
