    "solution": "(c)\n(c)\n(d)\n(a)\n(c)\n(c)\n$\\frac{1}{2} log⁡|sin⁡x-cos⁡x|+ \\frac{1}{2} x+c$\n$\\frac{1}{2} {tan}^{-1}⁡ \\left( {x}^{2} \\right) +c$\n(i)  $\\frac{1}{{b}^{3}}  \\left( a+bx-2alog⁡|a+bx|- \\frac{{a}^{2}}{(a+bx)} \\right) +c$ \n(ii)  $\\frac{-cos⁡2x}{8} - \\frac{cos⁡4x}{16} + \\frac{cos⁡6x}{24} +sin⁡2x+tan⁡x- \\left( \\frac{253}{128} \\right) x- \\frac{1}{128} sin⁡4x+ \\frac{1}{1024} sin⁡8x$\n1\n(a)  $\\pm 4sin⁡ \\frac{x}{4} \\mp 4cos⁡ \\frac{x}{4} +c$ \n(b)  $(-2) \\left( \\sqrt{1-x} - \\frac{2}{3} (1-x{)}^{\\frac{3}{2}}+ \\frac{1}{5} (1-x{)}^{\\frac{5}{2}} \\right) +c$\n$xsin⁡x+cos⁡x- \\frac{cos⁡2x}{4} +c$\n$\\frac{{e}^{x}}{(x+1{)}^{2}} +c$\n$-{\\left( 1+ \\frac{1}{{x}^{4}} \\right)}^{\\frac{1}{4}}+c$\n$-2 \\sqrt{1-x} +{cos}^{-1}⁡ \\sqrt{x} + \\sqrt{x(1-x)} +c$\n$x- \\frac{4x}{\\pi } {cos}^{-1}⁡ \\sqrt{x} - \\frac{2}{\\pi } {sin}^{-1}⁡ \\sqrt{x} + \\frac{2}{\\pi }  \\sqrt{x}  \\sqrt{1-x} +C$\n$\\sqrt{2} log⁡ \\left( \\frac{\\sqrt{{cot}^{2}⁡x-1} + \\sqrt{2{cot}^{2}⁡x}}{\\sqrt{{cot}^{2}⁡x+1}} \\right) -log⁡ \\left( cot⁡x+ \\sqrt{{cot}^{2}⁡x-1} \\right) +c$\n$\\sqrt{2} {tan}^{-1}⁡ \\left( \\frac{tan⁡x-1}{\\sqrt{2}  \\sqrt{tan⁡x}} \\right) +c$\n$\\frac{3}{2} {x}^{2/3}- \\frac{12}{7} {x}^{7/12}+2{x}^{1/2}- \\frac{12}{5} {x}^{5/12}+3{x}^{1/3}-4{x}^{1/4}+6{x}^{1/6}-12{x}^{1/12}+ln⁡ \\left( {x}^{1/12}+1 \\right)$\n$+6 \\left( \\left( \\frac{{\\left( 1+{x}^{1/6} \\right)}^{3}}{3} - \\frac{3{\\left( 1+{x}^{1/6} \\right)}^{2}}{2} +3 \\left( 1+{x}^{1/6} \\right) \\right) \\times ln⁡ \\left( 1+{x}^{1/6} \\right) - \\left( \\frac{{\\left( 1+{x}^{1/6} \\right)}^{3}}{3} - \\frac{3}{4} {\\left( 1+{x}^{1/6} \\right)}^{2}-3 \\left( 1+{x}^{1/6} \\right) \\right) - \\frac{1}{2}  \\left( ln⁡{\\left( 1+{x}^{1/6} \\right)}^{2} \\right) \\right)$\n$\\frac{1}{2} sin⁡2\\theta log⁡ \\left( \\frac{cos⁡\\theta +sin⁡\\theta }{cos⁡\\theta -sin⁡\\theta } \\right) + \\frac{1}{2} log⁡cos⁡2\\theta +C$\n$log⁡ \\left( \\frac{x{e}^{x}}{1+x{e}^{x}} \\right) + \\frac{1}{1+x{e}^{x}} +C$\n$2{cos}^{-1}⁡ \\sqrt{x} -2log⁡ \\left( \\frac{1+ \\sqrt{1-x}}{\\sqrt{x}} \\right) +c$\n$\\frac{-1}{2} log⁡|x+1|+ \\frac{1}{4} log⁡ \\left( {x}^{2}+1 \\right) + \\frac{3}{2} {tan}^{-1}⁡x+ \\frac{x}{1+{x}^{2}} +C$\n$(x+1){tan}^{-1}⁡ \\left( \\frac{2x+2}{3} \\right) - \\frac{3}{4} log⁡ \\left( \\frac{4{x}^{2}+8x+13}{9} \\right) +c$\n$\\frac{1}{6(m+1)} {\\left( 2{x}^{3m}+3{x}^{2m}+6{x}^{m} \\right)}^{(m+1)/m}+c$   26.  $\\frac{-3x}{2} + \\frac{35}{36} log⁡ \\left( 9{e}^{2x}-4 \\right) +C$   27.(d)",
