    "number": "4",
    "type": "numerical",
    "text": "The no. of real solutions of ${tan}^{-1} \\sqrt{x(x+1)} +{sin}^{-1} \\sqrt{{x}^{2}+x+1} = \\frac{\\pi }{2}$ is",
    "images": [],
