    "id": "jee_adv_math_inverse_trigonometric_functions_7",
    "number": "7",
    "type": "single mcq",
    "text": "If $0<x<1$ , then $\\sqrt{1+{x}^{2}} {\\left( {\\left( xcos \\left( {cot}^{-1}x \\right) +sin \\left( {cot}^{-1}x \\right) \\right)}^{2}-1 \\right)}^{1/2}=$",
    "images": [],
