    "type": "single mcq",
    "text": "Let $(x,y)$ be such that ${sin}^{-1}(ax)+{cos}^{-1}(y)+{cos}^{-1}(bxy)= \\frac{\\pi }{2}$ . (i) If $a=1$ and",
