    "type": "numerical",
    "text": "For a real number $y$ , let $[y]$ denote the greatest integer less than or equal to $y$ . Then the function $f(x)= \\frac{tan\\pi [(x-\\pi )]}{1+[x{]}^{2}}$ is",
    "images": [],
