    "number": "5",
    "type": "single mcq",
    "text": "If $f(a)=2,{f}^{'}(a)=1,g(a)=-1,{g}^{'}(a)=2$ then the value of $limx\\rightarrow a \\frac{g(x)f(a)-g(a)f(x)}{x-a}$ is",
    "images": [],
