    "type": "numerical",
    "text": "If $limx\\rightarrow 0 {\\left( 1+xln \\left( 1+{b}^{2} \\right) \\right)}^{1/x}=2b{sin}^{2}\\theta ,b>0$ and $\\theta \\in (-\\pi ,\\pi ]$ , then the value of $\\theta$ is",
