    "text": "Let $\\alpha (a)$ and $\\beta (a)$ be the roots of the equation $( \\sqrt[3]{1+a} -1){x}^{2}+( \\sqrt{1+a} -1)x+( \\sqrt[6]{1+a} -1)=0$ where $a>-1$ . Then $lima\\rightarrow {0}^{+} \\alpha (a)$ and $lima\\rightarrow {0}^{+} \\beta (a)$ are",
