    "number": "38",
    "type": "numerical",
    "text": "Let $k\\in R$ . If $limx\\rightarrow {0}^{+} (sin(sinkx)+cosx+x{)}^{\\frac{2}{x}}={e}^{6}$ , then the value of $k$ is",
    "images": [],
