    "text": "Let $f:[a,b]\\rightarrow [1,\\infty )$ be a continuous function and let $g:R\\rightarrow R$ be defined as $g(x)= \\left( \\begin{bmatrix} 0, & if & xb \\end{bmatrix} \\right)$ Then",
