    "id": "jee_adv_math_limits_continuity_and_differentiability_63",
    "number": "63",
    "type": "multiple mcq",
    "text": "Let $f(x)= \\frac{1-x(1+|1-x|)}{|1-x|} cos \\left( \\frac{1}{1-x} \\right)$ for $x\\neq 1$ . Then",
    "images": [],
