    "number": "138",
    "type": "numerical",
    "text": "The value of the limit ${lim}_{x\\rightarrow \\frac{\\pi }{2}} \\frac{4 \\sqrt{2} (sin3x+sinx)}{\\left( 2sin2xsin \\frac{3x}{2} +cos \\frac{5x}{2} \\right) - \\left( \\sqrt{2} + \\sqrt{2} cos2x+cos \\frac{3x}{2} \\right)}$ is $$",
    "images": [],
