    "text": "If $ω(\\neq 1)$ is a cube root of unity, then $\\left( \\begin{bmatrix} 1 & 1+i+{ω}^{2} & {ω}^{2} \\\\ 1-i & -1 & {ω}^{2}-1 \\\\ -i & -i+ω-1 & -1 \\end{bmatrix} \\right) =$",
