    "number": "8",
    "type": "single mcq",
    "text": "If $f(x)= \\left( \\begin{bmatrix} 1 & x & x+1 \\\\ 2x & x(x-1) & (x+1)x \\\\ 3x(x-1) & x(x-1)(x-2) & (x+1)x(x-1) \\end{bmatrix} \\right)$ then $f(100)$ equals",
