    "text": "The no. of distinct real roots of $\\left( \\begin{bmatrix} sinx & cosx & cosx \\\\ cosx & sinx & cosx \\\\ cosx & cosx & sinx \\end{bmatrix} \\right) =0$ in the interval $- \\frac{\\pi }{4} \\leq x\\leq \\frac{\\pi }{4}$ is",
