    "text": "Show $\\left( \\begin{bmatrix} {}^{x}{C}_{r} & {}^{x}{C}_{r+1} & {}^{x}{C}_{r+2} \\\\ {}^{y}{C}_{r} & {}^{y}{C}_{r+1} & {}^{y}{C}_{r+2} \\\\ {}^{z}{C}_{r} & {}^{z}{C}_{r+1} & {}^{z}{C}_{r+2} \\end{bmatrix} \\right) = \\left( \\begin{bmatrix} {}^{x}{C}_{r} & {}^{x+1}{C}_{r+1} & {}^{x+2}{C}_{r+2} \\\\ {}^{y}{C}_{r} & {}^{y+1}{C}_{r} & {}^{z+1}{C}_{r+1} \\end{bmatrix} {}^{y+2}{C}_{r+2}{}^{z+2}{C}_{r+2} \\right)$",
