    "text": "The common tangents to the circle ${x}^{2}+{y}^{2}=2$ and the parabola ${y}^{2}=8x$ touch the circle at the point $P,Q$ and the parabola at the points $R,S$ . Then the area of the quadrilateral $PQRS$ is",
