    "text": "If $P$ is a point on ${C}_{1}$ and $Q$ is another point on ${C}_{2}$ , then $\\frac{P{A}^{2}+P{B}^{2}+P{C}^{2}+P{D}^{2}}{Q{A}^{2}+Q{B}^{2}+Q{C}^{2}+Q{D}^{2}}$ is equal to",
