    "text": "Consider the parabola ${y}^{2}=8x$ . Let ${\\Delta }_{1}$ be the area of the triangle formed by the end points of its latus rectum and the point $P \\left( \\frac{1}{2} ,2 \\right)$ on the parabola, and ${\\Delta }_{2}$ be the area of the triangle formed by drawing tangents at $P$ and at the end points of the latus rectum. Then $\\frac{{\\Delta }_{1}}{{\\Delta }_{2}}$ is",
