    "number": "43",
    "type": "subjective",
    "text": "The coordinates of $A,B,C$ are $(6,3),(-3,5),(4,-2)$ respectively and $P$ is any point ( $x,y$ ). Show that the ratio of the areas of $△PBC,△ABC$ is $\\left( \\frac{x+y-2}{7} \\right)$ .",
