    "number": "64",
    "type": "subjective",
    "text": "A line is drawn passing through $P(h,k)$ and parallel to $x$ -axis. If the area of triangle formed by this line and lines $y=x$ and $x+y=2$ is $4{h}^{2}$ , then find the locus of $P$ $(h,k)$ .",
