    "text": "No tangent can be drawn from the point $\\left( \\frac{5}{2} ,1 \\right)$ to the circumcircle of the $\\Delta$ with vertices $(1, \\sqrt{3} ),(1,- \\sqrt{3} )$ , $(3, \\sqrt{3} )$ .",
