    "solution": "<p><strong>Ans: A -> s; B -> p, q; C -> r; D -> p, q, s</strong></p><p><strong>Step-by-step Solution:</strong><br/>By evaluating the given conditions for the parameter $k$ in $L_2$ relative to the fixed lines $L_1$ and $L_3$, we can map the scenarios (parallelism, concurrency, triangles formed) to the specified outcomes.<br/>Comparing slopes and applying the concurrency condition (determinant of coefficients equals zero) leads to the matched sets.</p>",
