    "solution": "<p><strong>Ans: b</strong></p><p><strong>Step-by-step Solution:</strong><br/>India plays a total of 4 matches. Max points = 8.<br/>Probabilities of getting 0, 1, 2 points in a match are 0.45, 0.05, and 0.50 respectively.<br/>To get at least 7 points in 4 matches, the point combinations must be:<br/>Case 1: 8 points (2 points in all 4 matches)<br/>Probability = $(0.50)^4 = 0.0625$.<br/>Case 2: 7 points (2 points in 3 matches, 1 point in 1 match)<br/>The 1 point match can be any of the 4 matches.<br/>Probability = $4 \\times (0.50)^3 \\times 0.05 = 4 \\times 0.125 \\times 0.05 = 0.025$.<br/>Total probability = $0.0625 + 0.025 = 0.0875$.</p>",
