    "type": "subjective",
    "text": "If ${log}_{3}2,{log}_{3} \\left( {2}^{x}-5 \\right)$ and ${log}_{3} \\left( {2}^{x}- \\frac{7}{2} \\right)$ are in arithmetic progression, determine the value of $x$ .",
    "images": [],
