    "number": "51",
    "type": "fill_in_the_blanks",
    "text": "The sides of a triangle inscribed in a given circle subtend angles $\\alpha ,\\beta$ and $\\gamma$ at the centre. The minimum value of the arithmetic mean of $cos \\left( \\alpha + \\frac{\\pi }{2} \\right) ,cos \\left( \\beta + \\frac{\\pi }{2} \\right)$ and $cos \\left( \\gamma + \\frac{\\pi }{2} \\right)$ is equal to $$",
    "images": [],
