    "text": "The sum of the first $n$ terms of the series ${1}^{2}+2⋅{2}^{2}+{3}^{2}+2⋅{4}^{2}+{5}^{2}+2⋅{6}^{2}+…….$ . is $\\frac{n(n+1{)}^{2}}{2}$ , when $n$ is even. when $n$ is odd, the sum is $$ _____________",
