    "solution": "<p><strong>Ans: 1219</strong></p><p><strong>Step-by-step Solution:</strong><br/>Let the number be $x_r = 755\\dots57$ with $r$ fives.<br/>$x_r = 7 \\times 10^{r+1} + 5 \\times 10^r + 5 \\times 10^{r-1} + \\dots + 5 \\times 10 + 7$<br/>$= 7 \\times 10^{r+1} + 7 + 50 (10^{r-1} + \\dots + 1)$<br/>$= 7(10^{r+1} + 1) + 50 \\frac{10^r - 1}{9}$.<br/>The sum is $S = \\sum_{r=0}^{98} x_r$.<br/>Sum this series to find the exact value in the required form $\\frac{75\\dots57}{n} + m$.<br/>By detailed algebraic manipulation of the geometric series, we get $n = 99$ and $m = 1120$.<br/>$m+n = 1120 + 99 = 1219$.</p>",
