    "text": "Find all values of $\\theta$ in the interval $\\left( - \\frac{\\pi }{2} , \\frac{\\pi }{2} \\right)$ satisfying the equation $(1-tan\\theta )(1+tan\\theta ){sec}^{2}\\theta +{2}^{{tan}^{2}\\theta }=0$",
