    "text": "Consider the following lists List-IList-IList-IIList-II(I)$\\left( \\begin{bmatrix} x\\in \\left( - \\frac{2\\pi }{3} , \\frac{2\\pi }{3} \\right) : \\\\ cosx+sinx=1 \\end{bmatrix} \\right)$(P)has two elements(II)$\\left( \\begin{bmatrix} x\\in \\left( - \\frac{5\\pi }{18} , \\frac{5\\pi }{18} \\right) : \\\\ \\sqrt{3} tan3x=1 \\end{bmatrix} \\right)$(Q)has three elements(III)$\\left( \\begin{bmatrix} x\\in \\left( - \\frac{6\\pi }{5} , \\frac{6\\pi }{5} \\right) : \\\\ 2cos(2x)= \\sqrt{3} \\end{bmatrix} \\right)$(R)has four elements(IV)$\\left( \\begin{bmatrix} x\\in \\left( - \\frac{7\\pi }{4} , \\frac{7\\pi }{4} \\right) : \\\\ sinx-cosx=1 \\end{bmatrix} \\right)$(S)has five elements(T)has six elements The correct option is :",
