    "id": "jee_adv_math_trigonometric_equations_50",
    "number": "50",
    "type": "numerical",
    "text": "The positive integer value of $n>3$ satisfying the equation $\\frac{1}{sin \\frac{\\pi }{n}} = \\frac{1}{sin \\left( \\frac{2\\pi }{n} \\right)} + \\frac{1}{sin \\left( \\frac{3\\pi }{n} \\right)}$ is",
