    "text": "The number of distinct solutions of the equation $\\frac{5}{4} {cos}^{2}2x+{cos}^{4}x+{sin}^{4}x+{cos}^{6}x+{sin}^{6}x=2$ in the interval $[0,2\\pi ]$ is",
