    "type": "numerical",
    "text": "Given both $\\theta$ and $\\phi$ are acute angles and $sin\\theta = \\frac{1}{2}$ , $cos\\phi= \\frac{1}{3}$ , then the value of $\\theta +\\phi$ belongs to",
