    "text": "$cos(\\alpha -\\beta )=1$ and $cos(\\alpha +\\beta )=1/e$ where $\\alpha ,\\beta \\in [-\\pi ,\\pi ]$ . Values of $\\alpha ,\\beta$ which satisfy both the equations is/are",
