    "text": "Let $\\theta \\in \\left( 0, \\frac{\\pi }{4} \\right)$ and ${t}_{1}=(tan\\theta {)}^{tan\\theta },{t}_{2}=(tan\\theta {)}^{cot\\theta }$ , ${t}_{3}=(cot\\theta {)}^{tan\\theta }$ and ${t}_{4}=(cot\\theta {)}^{cot\\theta }$ , then",
