    "text": "The value of ${∑}_{k=1}^{13} \\frac{1}{sin \\left( \\frac{\\pi }{4} + \\frac{(k-1)\\pi }{6} \\right) sin \\left( \\frac{\\pi }{4} + \\frac{k\\pi }{6} \\right)}$ is equal to",
    "images": [],
