    "text": "Suppose ${sin}^{3}xsin3x={∑}_{m=0}^{n} {C}_{m}cosnx$ is an identity in $x$ when ${C}_{0},{C}_{1},…,{C}_{n}$ are constants and ${C}_{n}\\neq 0$ then the value of $n=$ ____",
