    "text": "Let $f:[0,2]\\rightarrow R$ be the function defined by $f(x)=(3-sin(2\\pi x))sin \\left( \\pi x- \\frac{\\pi }{4} \\right) -sin \\left( 3\\pi x+ \\frac{\\pi }{4} \\right)$ . If $\\alpha ,\\beta \\in [0,2]$ are such that ${x\\in [0,2]:f(x)\\geq 0}=[\\alpha ,\\beta ]$ , then the value of $\\beta -\\alpha$ is ____ .",
