    "type": "single mcq",
    "text": "Let $\\vec{p} , \\vec{q} , \\vec{r}$ be three mutually perpendicular vectors of the same magnitude. If a vector $\\vec{x}$ satisfies the equation $\\vec{p} \\times (( \\vec{x} - \\vec{q} )\\times \\vec{p} )+ \\vec{q} \\times (( \\vec{x} - \\vec{r} )\\times \\vec{q} )+ \\vec{r} \\times (( \\vec{x} - \\vec{p} )\\times \\vec{r} )= \\vec{0}$ then $\\vec{x}$ is given by",
