    "text": "If $C$ is a given non zero scalar and $\\vec{A}$ and $\\vec{B}$ be given non zero vectors such that $\\vec{A} ⊥ \\vec{B}$ , find the vector $\\vec{X}$ which satisfies the equations $\\vec{A} ⋅ \\vec{X} =C, \\vec{A} \\times \\vec{X} = \\vec{B}$",
